{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1404","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Fixed Point Removal"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$a_1, \\ldots, a_n$$$ be an array of $$$n$$$ positive integers. In one operation, you can choose an index $$$i$$$ such that $$$a_i = i$$$, and remove $$$a_i$$$ from the array (after the removal, the remaining parts are concatenated)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The weight of $$$a$$$ is defined as the maximum number of elements you can remove."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You must answer $$$q$$$ independent queries $$$(x, y)$$$: after replacing the $$$x$$$ first elements of $$$a$$$ and the $$$y$$$ last elements of $$$a$$$ by $$$n+1$$$ (making them impossible to remove), what would be the weight of $$$a$$$?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, q \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$)  — the length of the array and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1$$$, $$$a_2$$$, ..., $$$a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq n$$$) — elements of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$q$$$ lines contains two integers $$$x$$$ and $$$y$$$ ($$$x, y \\ge 0$$$ and $$$x+y \\lt n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$q$$$ lines, $$$i$$$-th line should contain a single integer  — the answer to the $$$i$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n13 5\n2 2 3 9 5 4 6 5 7 8 3 11 13\n3 1\n0 0\n2 4\n5 0\n0 12\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n11\n6\n1\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 2\n1 4 1 2 4\n0 0\n1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Explanation of the first query:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After making first $$$x = 3$$$ and last $$$y = 1$$$ elements impossible to remove, $$$a$$$ becomes $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 5, 4, 6, 5, 7, 8, 3, 11, \\times]$$$ (we represent $$$14$$$ as $$$\\times$$$ for clarity)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here is a strategy that removes $$$5$$$ elements (the element removed is colored in red):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, \\color{red}{5}, 4, 6, 5, 7, 8, 3, 11, \\times]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 4, 6, 5, 7, 8, 3, \\color{red}{11}, \\times]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 4, \\color{red}{6}, 5, 7, 8, 3, \\times]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 4, 5, 7, \\color{red}{8}, 3, \\times]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 4, 5, \\color{red}{7}, 3, \\times]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[\\times, \\times, \\times, 9, 4, 5, 3, \\times]$$$ (final state) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is impossible to remove more than $$$5$$$ elements, hence the weight is $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1404C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1404/problem/C"}